OL,3,GNEWSAFears wildfire could reignite as
OL,4,Ahot spots remain
OL,5,
OL,6,FBut Suffolk Fire and Rescue Service
OL,7,Fsaid there were no further operational
OL,8,Frequirements needed from its crews.
